# API keys for the paid agent pilot (E5).
#
# How to use: put your OpenRouter key after the equals sign on the last line of the file named `.env`
# in this folder. No quotes, no spaces. Save the file. That is all.
#
# `.env` is git-ignored: it is never committed, and the pilot code never prints the key or writes it
# into any log or result file. This file, `.env.example`, is the empty template and is committed.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
